# The upstream proxy checkout the sync workflow makes (actions/checkout with
# a path). A working-directory artifact of the sync, never content: committed
# it becomes a gitlink with no .gitmodules, which every consumer that checks
# out submodules — Netlify among them — fails on.
/.audioproxy-src
